### Role summary

| Piece | Role |
| --- | --- |
| Third-party IdP | Issues the JWT the user already uses for the product |
| Product UI | Accepts that JWT; never talks to Coder as the user directly |
| CI/CD | Calls middle with machine credentials; never holds Coder Owner token |
| Middle service | Validates identity, mints/uses Coder tokens, owns run state machine, drives workspaces |
| Owner token | Server-side only; find/create users and mint per-user API tokens |
| Coder `session_token` | Used only between middle ↔ Coder (do **not** return raw Coder tokens to UI/CI) |
| Agent-job template | Sandbox + runner; no Coder dashboard UX required |

