## Template contract (agent-job template)

Dedicated template — not a developer desktop template.

| Concern | Proposal |
| --- | --- |
| Apps | Omit `coder_app` for terminal, code-server, AgentAPI UI, etc. |
| Agent | Keep `coder_agent` (required for start/scripts/status) |
| Input | `coder_parameter` values such as `prompt`, optional `repo_url`, `git_ref`, `job_id` — **and/or** middle delivers a job payload after start (long prompts / secrets) |
| Runner | `coder_script` on start: run Claude SDK (or equivalent); non-zero exit on failure |
| Output | Convention TBD: status file, HTTP callback to middle, object-store upload, PR opened by agent |
| Lifecycle | Short `ttl_ms` / autostop; middle deletes workspace when run completes or times out |
| Secrets | LLM keys via middle or template env — never from the browser |

