## Middle ↔ Coder API surface

Auth header for all Coder calls: `Coder-Session-Token: <token>`  
Base path: `/api/v2`

### A. Identity bridge (Owner token)

| Purpose | Method / path | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Find user by email/username | `GET /users?q=…` | Map IdP `email` / CI bot user |
| Create user (optional) | `POST /users` | If auto-provision enabled |
| Mint user API token | `POST /users/{user}/keys/tokens` | For subsequent user-scoped calls |
| List / revoke tokens (optional) | `GET` / `DELETE` … `/keys/tokens` | Rotation / cleanup |

### B. Template resolution (Owner or user token)

| Purpose | Method / path | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Resolve agent-job template | `GET /templates` or org-scoped template APIs | Prefer pinning id in middle config |
| Pin version (recommended) | Template + versions APIs | CI reproducibility: use `template_version_id` |

Exact org-scoped routes vary by deployment; production middle should treat **template id** and **template version id** as config.

### C. Job lifecycle = workspace lifecycle (user token)

| Purpose | Method / path | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **Create + start job** | `POST /users/{user}/workspaces` | `name`, `template_id` **or** `template_version_id`, `rich_parameter_values[]`, optional `ttl_ms` |
| Get workspace | `GET /workspaces/{workspace}` | Map to run status |
| List workspaces | `GET /workspaces?q=owner:…` | Cleanup / idempotency |
| Build status | `GET /workspacebuilds/{build}` | Provisioning success/failure |
| Start / stop | `POST /workspaces/{workspace}/builds` | Transition (start/stop) |
| Delete workspace | `DELETE /workspaces/{workspace}` | End of run / TTL breach |
| Agents / readiness | Workspace payload / agent endpoints | Detect agent ready / dead |

**Create body (illustrative):**

```json
{
  "name": "job-abc123",
  "template_version_id": "<pinned-uuid>",
  "ttl_ms": 3600000,
  "rich_parameter_values": [
    { "name": "prompt", "value": "…" },
    { "name": "job_id", "value": "abc123" }
  ]
}
```

### D. Not required for v1

| Capability | Why deferred |
| --- | --- |
| Agent PTY / terminal WebSocket | No interactive terminal |
| App reverse-proxy / code-server | No IDE embed |
| Coder Tasks / Chats / Agents APIs | Replaced by workspace + in-workspace runner |
| Coder OIDC login for end users | Middle + IdP JWT / CI auth instead |

### E. Optional later (result plumbing)

| Purpose | Options |
| --- | --- |
| Stream logs | Build/agent log APIs, or agent pushes to middle |
| Artifacts | Agent uploads to object storage; middle stores URLs on the run |
| Notify completion | Workspace → middle webhook (good for CI wait) |

Official workspace create docs: https://coder.com/docs/reference/api/workspaces

