## Middle external API (UI + CI)

Stable contract so CI/CD and the product UI do **not** learn Coder APIs.

| Endpoint (illustrative) | Role |
| --- | --- |
| `POST /v1/session` (if approach B) | Exchange IdP JWT → middle session |
| `POST /v1/runs` | Start job: `{ prompt, context, template?, idempotency_key? }` → `{ run_id }` |
| `GET /v1/runs/{run_id}` | Status: `queued \| provisioning \| running \| succeeded \| failed \| cancelled` + result refs |
| `POST /v1/runs/{run_id}/cancel` | Stop/delete underlying workspace |
| `GET /v1/runs/{run_id}/artifacts` | List outputs |

**CI pattern:** pipeline calls `POST /v1/runs`, polls `GET` until terminal (or waits on webhook), fails the step on `failed`. Use `idempotency_key` so retries do not spawn duplicate workspaces.

